# Files that must NOT be deployed as public static assets.
#
# There is no build step here, so Vercel publishes the repo as-is: every
# tracked file becomes a URL. Before this file existed, all of the following
# were live and downloadable by anyone:
#
#   /supabase_migration.sql   200  7,491 B   full schema + every RLS policy
#   /PROJECT_STATUS.md        200 21,893 B   internal roadmap
#   /docs/CHANGELOG.md        200 36,186 B   internal history
#   /CLAUDE.md                200  2,807 B   internal working notes
#
# The SQL is the worst of it: it hands an attacker the exact table, column and
# policy layout to aim the public anon key at. robots.txt is not a substitute —
# it asks crawlers not to look, it does not stop anyone fetching the URL.

# Database schema and policies
*.sql

# Internal documentation and working notes
*.md
docs/

# Tooling output
graphify-out/

# Repo metadata
.gitignore
.repomixignore
